{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wrath and Retribution",
    "steam_appid": 3367520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/430bc5c2e329c8bae421d2e6c3fc4b7e.webp?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through a solar system on the brink of disaster and drive out the invading forces of the Remnants in this intense action-packed space combat roguelike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/08132d8a667f423ac0f864e382e5231d.poster.avif?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/08132d8a667f423ac0f864e382e5231d.webm?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/08132d8a667f423ac0f864e382e5231d.mp4?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/2753cf5878553d922aa89fdb39f345f0.webp?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Remnants launched a full-scale invasion on Union territory and have taken over the Solar Transportation Network. But without knowledge of the complex technology, a devastating calamity looms, and the access points to the network threaten to rip everything apart in a disastrous singularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the  pilot of a spaceship with groundbreaking propulsion technology, now spearheading the counter-strike against Remnant forces across various planet hubs. You are joined by your onboard companion, <strong>Merlin</strong>, who automatically supports you with various active and passive skills throughout your encounters. Now it's up to you to secure the transportation network. Drive out the Remnants and ensure <u><strong>RETRIBUTION</strong></u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/ebe0cd76ebe2e3ddca7251ebf0c0b52e.poster.avif?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/ebe0cd76ebe2e3ddca7251ebf0c0b52e.webm?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/ebe0cd76ebe2e3ddca7251ebf0c0b52e.mp4?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/c7bdfe9e891eb5cc6a65d48a3e46b982.webp?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Intense 3D Space Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling dogfights and strategic battles against massive warships. Destroy shield generators, engines, and turrets to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in procedurally generated missions that last 5\u20137 minutes, offering high replayability with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Onboard companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship\u2019s AI, Merlin, automatically supports you in combat, executing abilities and assisting in strategic maneuvers. Upgrade Merlin\u2019s skills to create powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Customizable Builds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards to upgrade weapons, ship modules, and AI abilities. Experiment with specialized skills like friend-or-foe disruption or improved dash abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>High-stakes battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles in hubs like Mars or Jupiter to prevent the catastrophic collapse of the Solar Transportation Network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Permadeath pressure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and upgrade your ship between missions to survive. One mistake could spell the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/d8db338dee864e1bf19cc1f029c6d821.poster.avif?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/d8db338dee864e1bf19cc1f029c6d821.webm?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/d8db338dee864e1bf19cc1f029c6d821.mp4?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/430bc5c2e329c8bae421d2e6c3fc4b7e.webp?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through a solar system on the brink of disaster and drive out the invading forces of the Remnants in this intense action-packed space combat roguelike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/08132d8a667f423ac0f864e382e5231d.poster.avif?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/08132d8a667f423ac0f864e382e5231d.webm?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/08132d8a667f423ac0f864e382e5231d.mp4?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/2753cf5878553d922aa89fdb39f345f0.webp?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Remnants launched a full-scale invasion on Union territory and have taken over the Solar Transportation Network. But without knowledge of the complex technology, a devastating calamity looms, and the access points to the network threaten to rip everything apart in a disastrous singularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the  pilot of a spaceship with groundbreaking propulsion technology, now spearheading the counter-strike against Remnant forces across various planet hubs. You are joined by your onboard companion, <strong>Merlin</strong>, who automatically supports you with various active and passive skills throughout your encounters. Now it's up to you to secure the transportation network. Drive out the Remnants and ensure <u><strong>RETRIBUTION</strong></u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/ebe0cd76ebe2e3ddca7251ebf0c0b52e.poster.avif?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/ebe0cd76ebe2e3ddca7251ebf0c0b52e.webm?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/ebe0cd76ebe2e3ddca7251ebf0c0b52e.mp4?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/c7bdfe9e891eb5cc6a65d48a3e46b982.webp?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Intense 3D Space Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling dogfights and strategic battles against massive warships. Destroy shield generators, engines, and turrets to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in procedurally generated missions that last 5\u20137 minutes, offering high replayability with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Onboard companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship\u2019s AI, Merlin, automatically supports you in combat, executing abilities and assisting in strategic maneuvers. Upgrade Merlin\u2019s skills to create powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Customizable Builds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards to upgrade weapons, ship modules, and AI abilities. Experiment with specialized skills like friend-or-foe disruption or improved dash abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>High-stakes battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles in hubs like Mars or Jupiter to prevent the catastrophic collapse of the Solar Transportation Network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Permadeath pressure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and upgrade your ship between missions to survive. One mistake could spell the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/d8db338dee864e1bf19cc1f029c6d821.poster.avif?t=1752754858\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/d8db338dee864e1bf19cc1f029c6d821.webm?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/d8db338dee864e1bf19cc1f029c6d821.mp4?t=1752754858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
